{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1135050-pernstow-castle-a-demon-story-idea","id":1135050,"title":"Pernstow Castle ( A Demon Story idea)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-28T20:44:35-07:00","id":1135050,"title":"Pernstow Castle ( A Demon Story idea)","content":"<div align=\"center\">I came up with a idea for a Demon scenario set in a castle in Scotland. The basic idea is that a God Machine influenced conglomerate in the UAE called Harroun International buys out a castle in Scotland called Pernstow and turns it into a resort after keeping their plans for it secret for five years. The local demon ring however, is suspicious of this newly opened resort and sends you in to search it for any infastructure. Coincidentally, some of Harroun's major executives are meeting at the Castle at the exact same day for a stockholders meeting with their European and North American investors. Giving you a chance to figure out the company's next move. But beware, who knows what lurks within Pernstow Castle.<br /> <br /> Can i have some advice on what type of infastructure to place inside the castle and how to make the castle itself a interesting location?</div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-29T04:42:41-07:00","id":1135127,"title":"","content":"I came up with two ideas<br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Information:</b> Have you ever wanted a new you? Feeling run down? Well come to Pernstow castle and enjoy our new world class spa. Here we put the old tired you to rest and help you become a new more energetic you for the whole world. The Infrastructure is designed to contain as many people as it needs so no matter how many people come there is always more room.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Type:</b> Elimination + Concealment</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Function:</b> Deconstruct old Angelic Covers eliminating bits no longer needed and taking useful bits and constructing new covers.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Security:</b> Cultists, Large Cryptid in the bottom of the castle a metal dragon, tier 3 guardian angel</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Linchpin:</b> Spa Room 44. It never used but inside is a spa pool that is 444m deep. This room is used to decommission old covers. Swimming to the bottom of the pool Eliminates covers if you continue to swim you will come out in room 88 were new covers are given.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Information:</b> Have you ever wanted a new you? Feeling run down? Well come to Pernstow castle and enjoy our new world class spa. Here we put the old tired you to rest and help you become a new more energetic you for the whole world. The Infrastructure is designed to contain as many people as it needs so no matter how many people come there is always more room. The infrastructure warps time and space so you can find people who have been staying at the hotel for decades but it's only been a few hours to them</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Type</b>: Defense</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Function:</b> Draw in demons and possible angelic covers and contain them and get them lost in the never ending spa/hotel</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Security:</b> Lare, 2x tier 2 guardian angel, Cultists, 1 Cryptid</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Linchpin:</b> A map in the basement of the castle. This map is ever-growing and changing. To do so it can't be scene so no one knows the true layout of the building. The Map is Protected by a cryptid dragon </span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-29T19:53:32-07:00","id":1135333,"title":"","content":"Good ideas so far. I wonder how the stockholders meeting could work if the Infrastructures' main purpose is to trap people?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-29T20:48:31-07:00","id":1135342,"title":"","content":"Maybe it's not incorporated or they meet somewhere else","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.j